      "title": "Constructive history: From the standard theory of stages to Piaget\u2019s new theory",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Jeremy Trevelyan Burman",
          "openalex_id": "A5046246272",
          "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4409-8260",
